flowchart TD
    START[dispatchViaOpenClaw] --> A[adaptiveRoute to routing]
    A --> B{selected_endpoint?}
    B -->|No| C[Return failed NO_ENDPOINT]
    B -->|Yes| D[callModelApi Primary endpoint]
    
    D --> E{Success?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Return success fallback_results=null]
    E -->|No| G{Has fallback_endpoints?}
    
    G -->|No| H[Return failed ALL_ENDPOINTS_FAILED]
    G -->|Yes| I[Iterate fallback endpoints max 2]
    
    I --> J[callModelApi Fallback endpoint]
    J --> K{Success?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Return success Marked as fallback]
    K -->|No| M{More fallback endpoints?}
    M -->|Yes| I
    M -->|No| H

    style F fill:#e8f5e9
    style L fill:#fff3e0
    style C fill:#ffebee
    style H fill:#ffebee
